cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Orbit, cite it as below.
type: software
title: Orbit
abstract: >-
  A multi-agent coding team (planner, coder, test runner, critic, and a
  reviewer written as code) where every turn is one JSON object validated
  against its role's schema and a patch ships only when the tests pass. The
  frozen evaluations, the measured scores, and a QLoRA fine-tune of the team
  protocol are in the repository.
keywords:
  - multi-agent systems
  - LLM agents
  - tool use
  - evaluation
  - QLoRA
authors:
